sequenceDiagram
    participant MobileApp as Mobile App (Agent)
    participant Server as NestJS API (/api/v1)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over MobileApp,DB: Session Lifecycle
    MobileApp->>Server: POST /sessions/active (JWT)
    Server->>DB: Find UserSession where lastBeat within 5 min
    DB-->>Server: existing session or null
    alt Session exists (within timeout)
        Server->>DB: UPDATE lastBeat=now, duration
        DB-->>Server: updated session
        Server-->>MobileApp: { first_beat, last_beat, is_active: true, duration }
    else No active session (timeout exceeded)
        Server->>DB: INSERT UserSession (firstBeat=now, lastBeat=now)
        Server->>DB: UPSERT ActiveSession
        DB-->>Server: new session
        Server-->>MobileApp: { first_beat, last_beat, is_active: true, duration: 0 }
    end

    Note over MobileApp: Heartbeat repeats every few minutes

    MobileApp->>Server: GET /sessions
    alt User role
        Server->>DB: Filter by current user
    else Admin role
        Server->>DB: Filter by query params
    end
    DB-->>Server: UserSessions[]
    Server->>DB: Find ActiveSessions
    DB-->>Server: active markers
    Server-->>MobileApp: [{ first_beat, last_beat, is_active, duration }]
